[I] Ministream is a small subset of libappstream

[T] Ministream is a small subset of libappstream, intended to be used by
[T] libadwaita to automatically populate its AboutDialog with data contained in
[T] the applications AppStream manifest. Unlike libappstream, this library only
[T] depends on GLib.

[U] https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/ministream

[A] GNOME
[M] andrei32 <andrei32.t2@gmail.com>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

[E] opt gobject-introspection

[L] LGPL
[V] 0.99.1

